{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 103,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless Jehovah, O my soul;\nAnd all that is within me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "bless",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his holy name.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless Jehovah, O my soul,\nAnd forget not all his benefits:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who forgiveth all thine iniquities;\nWho healeth all thy diseases;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who redeemeth thy life from destruction;\nWho crowneth thee with lovingkindness and tender mercies;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who satisfieth thy desire with good things,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "So that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy youth is renewed like the eagle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah executeth righteous acts,\nAnd judgments for all that are oppressed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He made known his ways unto Moses,\nHis doings unto the children of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is merciful and gracious,\nSlow to anger, and abundant in lovingkindness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will not always chide;\nNeither will he keep ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his anger",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath not dealt with us after our sins,\nNor rewarded us after our iniquities.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For as the heavens are high above the earth,\nSo great is his lovingkindness toward them that fear him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As far as the east is from the west,\nSo far hath he removed our transgressions from us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Like as a father pitieth his children,\nSo Jehovah pitieth them that fear him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he knoweth our frame;\nHe remembereth that we are dust.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for man, his days are as grass;\nAs a flower of the field, so he flourisheth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the wind passeth over it, and it is gone;\nAnd the place thereof shall know it no more.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the lovingkindness of Jehovah is from everlasting to everlasting upon them that fear him,\nAnd his righteousness unto children’s children;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To such as keep his covenant,\nAnd to those that remember his precepts to do them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah hath established his throne in the heavens;\nAnd his kingdom ruleth over all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless Jehovah, ye his angels,\nThat are mighty in strength, that fulfil his word,\nHearkening unto the voice of his word.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless Jehovah, all ye his hosts,\nYe ministers of his, that do his pleasure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.103.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.103.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless Jehovah, all ye his works,\nIn all places of his dominion:\nBless Jehovah, O my soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Praise for Jehovah’s mercies.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Psalm of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
